{"step_index":244,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-21T10:34:31Z","input_tokens":7896,"cache_read_tokens":195110,"output_tokens":703,"content":"# 💎 Professional Enterprise Design & Typography Overhaul Complete\n\nThe visual design system of **NexusMobility** has been enhanced with generous breathing room, enterprise typography scaling, refined letter spacing, and balanced container padding.\n\n---\n\n### 🎨 Key Enhancements Applied\n\n#### 1. Professional Typography & Letter Spacing\n- **Brand Title & Headers**: Upgraded to high-contrast `Inter` font weights (`font-weight: 800` for titles, `font-weight: 700` for section cards) with clean, subtle negative tracking (`letter-spacing: -0.025em`) to eliminate clumsy letter spreading and give a modern SaaS look (matching Stripe/Apple Mobility design standards).\n- **Subtitles & Descriptions**: Relaxed line-height (`line-height: 1.5` to `1.6`) with muted slate tones (`#64748B`), providing comfortable reading distance.\n- **Micro-labels & Telemetry Badges**: Set in crisp monospace (`JetBrains Mono`) with positive tracking (`letter-spacing: 0.04em` to `0.07em`) for distinct technical clarity.\n\n#### 2. Generous Spatial Padding & Breathing Room\n- **Outer Application Shell**: Expanded padding to `padding: 2rem 2.5rem 4rem;` with an increased max-width of `1680px`.\n- **Card Padding**: Increased from tight `1.25rem` up to `2.25rem` inside form panels, cards, and modal dialogs.\n- **Section Headers**: Structured with `padding-bottom: 1.15rem;` and clear 1px bottom borders to cleanly demarcate headers from form fields.\n- **Interactive Inputs**: Increased input field height with `padding: 0.75rem 1.05rem;`, rounded `12px` corners, and softer border tones (`1.5px solid #E2E8F0`).\n- **Action Buttons**: Sized to a comfortable `padding: 0.725rem 1.45rem;` with `12px` rounded radii, refined hover elevations (`translateY(-2px)`), and soft drop shadows.\n\n#### 3. 2-Column Balanced Dashboard Grid\n- **Trip Planning Panel**: Sized to a solid `440px` left column with dedicated vertical spacing between station selectors, the circular interchange button, and the commuter density slider.\n- **3D Spatial Canvas**: Expanded to `500px` height with clean HUD overlay padding (`1.25rem` offset) and high-contrast station markers.\n- **Telemetry Metric Strip**: Spaced into a comfortable 5-item grid with `1.15rem 1.45rem` internal padding.\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 To View the Refined Platform\nRefresh or open [`index.html`](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/index.html) in your browser. All cards, headings, and interactive widgets now present clean, professional proportions."}
